  "decision_conditions": [
    "The proposed removal and alteration of condition 9 to accommodate\r\nall uses within Use Class E would result in significant and detrimental impact\r\nto the amenity of neighbouring occupiers by way of increase noise and\r\ndisturbance arising the number of persons visiting the site, the site’s limited\r\nspace constraints, the immediate proximity to the residential properties and variety\r\nof potential uses on the site. The development would therefore be contrary to\r\nthe neighbouring amenity aspirations of the National Planning Policy Framework\r\n(2024), Policy D3.D(9) of The London Plan (2021), Core Policies CS1 and CS2 of\r\nthe Harrow Core Strategy (2012), Policies DM1 C, DM1 D (h) of the Harrow\r\nDevelopment Management Policies Local Plan (2013)."
